INSERT INTO episodes(id,title,date,audio_url,description,link,speaker,speaker_source) VALUES('0db854449241651160a9','2020 Is as Bad as We Thought | The Gospel of Jesus Is Better Than We Thought - (Luke 10)','2020-06-22','https://www.buzzsprout.com/21035/4345640-2020-is-as-bad-as-we-thought-the-gospel-of-jesus-is-better-than-we-thought-luke-10.mp3','If you think 2020 has been rough, then you''re exactly right. In some ways this year is unprecedented. But one thing we can count on is that God is awakening our world to the sins that have been hiding under the surface. It''s not just the sin "out there" in the world, but it is also the sin hiding in the dark crevices of our hearts. Pastor Daniel talks about finding joy in the midst of the pandemic, economic crash, and heightened awareness of racial injustices. Where do you look for joy? What do you think you need in order to be joyful? The answer is Jesus, but thankfully the answer is even more specific than this. Jesus tells us in Luke 10.','https://podcast.app/2020-is-as-bad-as-we-thought-the-gospel-of-jesus-is-better-than-we-thought-luke-10-e102501740','Pastor Daniel','description') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,date=excluded.date,audio_url=excluded.audio_url,description=excluded.description,link=excluded.link,speaker=excluded.speaker,speaker_source=excluded.speaker_source;
INSERT INTO episodes(id,title,date,audio_url,description,link,speaker,speaker_source) VALUES('b85bd731e222d1249651','Building Up The Body Of Christ | Living Out My Purpose','2020-06-15','https://www.buzzsprout.com/21035/4153922-building-up-the-body-of-christ-living-out-my-purpose.mp3','Building Up The Body Of Christ | Living Out My Purpose','https://podcast.app/building-up-the-body-of-christ-living-out-my-purpose-e100511262','','') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,date=excluded.date,audio_url=excluded.audio_url,description=excluded.description,link=excluded.link,speaker=excluded.speaker,speaker_source=excluded.speaker_source;
INSERT INTO episodes(id,title,date,audio_url,description,link,speaker,speaker_source) VALUES('7b60904755cbdcad1e95','Listening to Our Lord Jesus in Prayer | Living Out My Purpose','2020-06-08','https://www.buzzsprout.com/21035/4068284-listening-to-our-lord-jesus-in-prayer-living-out-my-purpose.mp3','Listening to Our Lord Jesus in Prayer | Living Out My Purpose There''s no point in learning about God if you''re not going to put what you learn into action. Faith in Jesus isn''t a school project where you learn facts, take a test, and get a grade. Faith is action. Faith is personal. Faith is obedience to God''s commands to (1) love God with all your heart, soul, mind, and strength, and to (2) love your neighbor as yourself! Angela and Pastor Daniel discuss racial biases and tensions, and also what #saymyname means. As a church, we must live out our faith in a broken world in a way that acknowledges the brokenness AND leads people to trust in the promises of God that say reconciliation is on its way. Pastor Daniel encourages us to take 10 minutes each day this week to be silent with God... to be alone with him and let him be the sole focus of our attention. With so many voices speaking in the world, it is imperative for the followers of Jesus to designate the voice of God as the primary one we are listening to. Prayer is not confined to us talking to God, but God reveals himself to us through prayer, Scripture, and the Spirit of God.','https://podcast.app/listening-to-our-lord-jesus-in-prayer-living-out-my-purpose-e99714332','Pastor Daniel','description') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,date=excluded.date,audio_url=excluded.audio_url,description=excluded.description,link=excluded.link,speaker=excluded.speaker,speaker_source=excluded.speaker_source;
INSERT INTO episodes(id,title,date,audio_url,description,link,speaker,speaker_source) VALUES('229c4680c8004faf8521','Sharing My Testimony | Living Out My Purpose | Connecting People to Jesus','2020-06-01','https://www.buzzsprout.com/21035/3987245-sharing-my-testimony-living-out-my-purpose-connecting-people-to-jesus.mp3','Sharing your testimony is one of the most powerful and effective things you can do as a Christian. It encourages fellow Christians to hear it, and it gives non-Christians a story to help them understand the good news (gospel) of Jesus and how they can also trust him as Lord. Many people feel like their testimony is not as good as others, but each testimony is different, powerful, personal, and miraculous. Today''s sermon shares 3 truths for all people regarding our need for Jesus, and we also hear from 3 different people as they share the story of how they came to faith in Jesus. Connection Church is starting a new sermon series called, "Living Out My Purpose." Our purpose statement is "Connection People to Jesus and One Another." For 8 weeks we are going to focus on how we can live this out in our lives. We hope today encourages you to be ready to share your testimony!','https://podcast.app/sharing-my-testimony-living-out-my-purpose-connecting-people-to-jesus-e98832428','','') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,date=excluded.date,audio_url=excluded.audio_url,description=excluded.description,link=excluded.link,speaker=excluded.speaker,speaker_source=excluded.speaker_source;
