INSERT INTO episodes(id,title,date,audio_url,description,link,speaker,speaker_source) VALUES('578950a72b31e8bae1f4','Stranger Beings - From My Hand to God''s','2018-05-06','https://www.buzzsprout.com/21035/699644-stranger-beings-from-my-hand-to-god-s.mp3','It is tempting to live life by your own power and ability, but sooner or later you will realize the limitations of your strength. Pastor Daniel teaches how we are to release our burdens of life from our limited grip into the all-powerful hand of God!Scripture Reading: 1 Peter 3:17-22','https://podcast.app/stranger-beings-from-my-hand-to-gods-e31473334','Pastor Daniel','description') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,date=excluded.date,audio_url=excluded.audio_url,description=excluded.description,link=excluded.link,speaker=excluded.speaker,speaker_source=excluded.speaker_source;
INSERT INTO episodes(id,title,date,audio_url,description,link,speaker,speaker_source) VALUES('55544528c33d9cefba47','Stranger Beings - Everyone Has A Story - What''s Yours?','2018-04-29','https://www.buzzsprout.com/21035/696586-stranger-beings-everyone-has-a-story-what-s-yours.mp3','Everyone Has A Story - What''s Yours? 1 Peter 3:13-16 Peter tells the Christians to be prepared to share the reason why they have hope in a hopeless world. This will be a chance to tell the story of Jesus and the new life they have in him. No matter who you are - you have a story to tell. The question you have to answer is: What''s your story?','https://podcast.app/stranger-beings-everyone-has-a-story-whats-yours-e31263469','','') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,date=excluded.date,audio_url=excluded.audio_url,description=excluded.description,link=excluded.link,speaker=excluded.speaker,speaker_source=excluded.speaker_source;
INSERT INTO episodes(id,title,date,audio_url,description,link,speaker,speaker_source) VALUES('bd09978315d5e5bca5b7','Stranger Beings - Bless And See Good Days','2018-04-22','https://www.buzzsprout.com/21035/696584-stranger-beings-bless-and-see-good-days.mp3','The call to Christlikeness is accompanied by the promises of blessing and a listening God. When we choose to bless others, God will choose to bless us both now and forever.Scripture Reading: 1 Peter 3:8-12','https://podcast.app/stranger-beings-bless-and-see-good-days-e31263470','','') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,date=excluded.date,audio_url=excluded.audio_url,description=excluded.description,link=excluded.link,speaker=excluded.speaker,speaker_source=excluded.speaker_source;
INSERT INTO episodes(id,title,date,audio_url,description,link,speaker,speaker_source) VALUES('fb6ba6120e5b1a02264e','Stranger Beings: Husband - A Name of Strength and Love','2018-04-15','https://www.buzzsprout.com/21035/687649-stranger-beings-husband-a-name-of-strength-and-love.mp3','When done right, marriage is a powerful display of God''s love in our world. The commitment, love, passion, and sacrifice within this relationship is like no other among people. Being a husband that honors the Lord takes faith and great strength, and it causes him to emulate the love of Jesus.Scripture Reading: 1 Peter 3:7 and Ephesians 5:25-33','https://podcast.app/stranger-beings-husband-a-name-of-strength-and-love-e30853960','','') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,date=excluded.date,audio_url=excluded.audio_url,description=excluded.description,link=excluded.link,speaker=excluded.speaker,speaker_source=excluded.speaker_source;
INSERT INTO episodes(id,title,date,audio_url,description,link,speaker,speaker_source) VALUES('598094f650e32368a304','Stranger Beings - Wife: A Name of Strength and Beauty','2018-04-08','https://www.buzzsprout.com/21035/678919-stranger-beings-wife-a-name-of-strength-and-beauty.mp3','When done right, marriage is a powerful display of God''s love in our world. The commitment, love, passion, and sacrifice within this relationship is like no other relationship among people. Being a wife that honors the Lord takes faith and great strength, and it causes her to be the epitome of beauty.Scripture Reading: 1 Peter 3:1-6','https://podcast.app/stranger-beings-wife-a-name-of-strength-and-beauty-e30418945','','') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,date=excluded.date,audio_url=excluded.audio_url,description=excluded.description,link=excluded.link,speaker=excluded.speaker,speaker_source=excluded.speaker_source;
INSERT INTO episodes(id,title,date,audio_url,description,link,speaker,speaker_source) VALUES('f834c2bfe22d1802a9d8','Stranger Beings - Look At What Jesus Did','2018-04-01','https://www.buzzsprout.com/21035/674816-stranger-beings-look-at-what-jesus-did.mp3','Scripture Reading: 1 Peter 2:21-25Focusing on what we have done can lead us to the extreme of feeling arrogant because we feel superior to others, or the other other extreme of feeling despondent because we feel we can never measure up. Easter reminds us to turn our eyes away from our own lives and set our eyes on Jesus and marvel at what he has done!','https://podcast.app/stranger-beings-look-at-what-jesus-did-e30173289','','') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,date=excluded.date,audio_url=excluded.audio_url,description=excluded.description,link=excluded.link,speaker=excluded.speaker,speaker_source=excluded.speaker_source;
INSERT INTO episodes(id,title,date,audio_url,description,link,speaker,speaker_source) VALUES('36e865454463824a5a74','Stranger Beings: How Suffering Leads to Justice','2018-03-25','https://www.buzzsprout.com/21035/668417-stranger-beings-how-suffering-leads-to-justice.mp3','When experiencing injustice in the world or in the workplace, God has a way for us to find favor from him that leads to justice and healing. The problem with his way is that it may not be the answer we want. Let''s look at 1 Peter 2:18-21 and see how justice, favor and submission work together in God''s plan.Scripture Reading: 1 Peter 2:18-21','https://podcast.app/stranger-beings-how-suffering-leads-to-justice-e29964828','','') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,date=excluded.date,audio_url=excluded.audio_url,description=excluded.description,link=excluded.link,speaker=excluded.speaker,speaker_source=excluded.speaker_source;
INSERT INTO episodes(id,title,date,audio_url,description,link,speaker,speaker_source) VALUES('8f7e2fd06e5f0d4fe79a','Stranger Beings: You Are Free!','2018-03-18','https://www.buzzsprout.com/21035/665404-stranger-beings-you-are-free.mp3','The freedom we have been given in Christ enables us to give of ourselves in ways that are bold and seen as careless by many. However, as we die to ourselves daily we find abundant life that is good for everyone around us in Christ Jesus.Scripture reading: 1 Peter 2:13-17','https://podcast.app/stranger-beings-you-are-free-e29765146','','') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,date=excluded.date,audio_url=excluded.audio_url,description=excluded.description,link=excluded.link,speaker=excluded.speaker,speaker_source=excluded.speaker_source;
INSERT INTO episodes(id,title,date,audio_url,description,link,speaker,speaker_source) VALUES('8fbda8167d1b2c9b96a2','Stranger Beings: Living Above The Law','2018-03-11','https://www.buzzsprout.com/21035/658926-stranger-beings-living-above-the-law.mp3','Sometimes people think the rules don’t apply to them, so they do whatever they want to do. It is said they think they are “above the law.” As a Christian we acknowledge a higher authority than the law of our land — God. This means we go above and beyond the laws of the land because of our faith in Christ. ‘Living above the law’ as a Christian means we observe and honor the laws of our land, and we strive to be exemplary in all our behavior. Our behavior can show a better way to be “living above the law.”Scripture reading: 1 Peter 2:11-12','https://podcast.app/stranger-beings-living-above-the-law-e29369665','','') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,date=excluded.date,audio_url=excluded.audio_url,description=excluded.description,link=excluded.link,speaker=excluded.speaker,speaker_source=excluded.speaker_source;
INSERT INTO episodes(id,title,date,audio_url,description,link,speaker,speaker_source) VALUES('b8e3bef79d8da0aa9ee6','Stranger Beings: Chosen For Excellence','2018-03-04','https://www.buzzsprout.com/21035/656378-stranger-beings-chosen-for-excellence.mp3','Do you ever wonder if your life is making a difference? Do you ever wonder if you bring value to the world? Maybe you know you bring value and make a difference, but you continually try to prove yourself to others. There is rest and assurance when we grasp the truth that God will make a difference in the world through us and be the power within us to accomplish this task. Pastor Daniel encourages us that now is the time to step out in faith and believe God does great work through his people. You are not normal; you are chosen by God for excellence.Scripture Reading: 1 Peter 2:9-10','https://podcast.app/stranger-beings-chosen-for-excellence-e29126193','Pastor Daniel','description') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,date=excluded.date,audio_url=excluded.audio_url,description=excluded.description,link=excluded.link,speaker=excluded.speaker,speaker_source=excluded.speaker_source;
INSERT INTO episodes(id,title,date,audio_url,description,link,speaker,speaker_source) VALUES('f25eaccc87eb7a158878','Stranger Beings: Stop Building Yourself Up','2018-02-25','https://www.buzzsprout.com/21035/652151-stranger-beings-stop-building-yourself-up.mp3','While believing positive things about yourself can improve your circumstances — believing God’s promises for your life will yield strength, peace, and security for your life now and forever. It’s time to stop building yourself up and surrender yourself to the Lord and allow him to build you up more than you ever thought possible.Scripture Reading: 1 Peter 2:4-8','https://podcast.app/stranger-beings-stop-building-yourself-up-e28759479','','') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,date=excluded.date,audio_url=excluded.audio_url,description=excluded.description,link=excluded.link,speaker=excluded.speaker,speaker_source=excluded.speaker_source;
INSERT INTO episodes(id,title,date,audio_url,description,link,speaker,speaker_source) VALUES('6b8a1eb2893651b5a538','Stranger Beings: Simplify Your Life','2018-02-18','https://www.buzzsprout.com/21035/652141-stranger-beings-simplify-your-life.mp3','In order to grow up into our salvation, we must long for the purity of the goodness of the LORD.Scripture Reading: 1 Peter2: 1-3','https://podcast.app/stranger-beings-simplify-your-life-e28759480','','') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,date=excluded.date,audio_url=excluded.audio_url,description=excluded.description,link=excluded.link,speaker=excluded.speaker,speaker_source=excluded.speaker_source;
INSERT INTO episodes(id,title,date,audio_url,description,link,speaker,speaker_source) VALUES('d0b798e12e0d5a13eda8','Stranger Beings: You Were Born For This','2018-02-11','https://www.buzzsprout.com/21035/643699-stranger-beings-you-were-born-for-this.mp3','We can search our whole lives trying to discover what we were born to do and never find it. Tonight we will see a few things we were born to do, and we will see how to fulfill our destiny in life.','https://podcast.app/stranger-beings-you-were-born-for-this-e28331614','','') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,date=excluded.date,audio_url=excluded.audio_url,description=excluded.description,link=excluded.link,speaker=excluded.speaker,speaker_source=excluded.speaker_source;
INSERT INTO episodes(id,title,date,audio_url,description,link,speaker,speaker_source) VALUES('9d0f3fc28266b9b5ae80','Stranger Beings: Fear For My Life','2018-02-04','https://www.buzzsprout.com/21035/637940-stranger-beings-fear-for-my-life.mp3','What role does "fear" play in your life? In this sermon we learn how to live in a healthy relationship with fear for the rest of our lives on earth. Fear isn''t something to be afraid of, but when used properly it can lead us to a life of victory and peace!Scripture Reading is from 1 Peter 1:17-21','https://podcast.app/stranger-beings-fear-for-my-life-e28031091','','') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,date=excluded.date,audio_url=excluded.audio_url,description=excluded.description,link=excluded.link,speaker=excluded.speaker,speaker_source=excluded.speaker_source;
INSERT INTO episodes(id,title,date,audio_url,description,link,speaker,speaker_source) VALUES('5ce7548ea22d236798b2','Stranger Beings: Gird Your Mind, Guard Your Heart','2018-01-28','https://www.buzzsprout.com/21035/637911-stranger-beings-gird-your-mind-guard-your-heart.mp3','Pastor Larry continues our series with a sermon reminding us to prepare our minds for the Christian walk. Scripture Reading: 1 Peter 1:13-16','https://podcast.app/stranger-beings-gird-your-mind-guard-your-heart-e28031092','','') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,date=excluded.date,audio_url=excluded.audio_url,description=excluded.description,link=excluded.link,speaker=excluded.speaker,speaker_source=excluded.speaker_source;
INSERT INTO episodes(id,title,date,audio_url,description,link,speaker,speaker_source) VALUES('894e442c138cce775fc0','Stranger Beings: I''m Not Over It!','2018-01-21','https://www.buzzsprout.com/21035/629340-stranger-beings-i-m-not-over-it.mp3','We have a great salvation through Christ, yet we can go days without appreciating it. There are many things in life we should "get over", but what Jesus has done for us is not one of them, Today''s message will inspire us to wake up every morning acknowledging the Lord and telling him, I''m NOT over it!.Scripture reading is from 1 Peter 1:10-12','https://podcast.app/stranger-beings-im-not-over-it-e27567028','','') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,date=excluded.date,audio_url=excluded.audio_url,description=excluded.description,link=excluded.link,speaker=excluded.speaker,speaker_source=excluded.speaker_source;
INSERT INTO episodes(id,title,date,audio_url,description,link,speaker,speaker_source) VALUES('8ee9b7cdd25edb46a95b','Stranger Beings: Christian Suffering','2018-01-14','https://www.buzzsprout.com/21035/629337-stranger-beings-christian-suffering.mp3','Guest Speaker David Ellis teaches on how Suffering in this life is different because of Jesus.Scripture Reading is from 1 Peter 1:3-9','https://podcast.app/stranger-beings-christian-suffering-e27567029','','') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,date=excluded.date,audio_url=excluded.audio_url,description=excluded.description,link=excluded.link,speaker=excluded.speaker,speaker_source=excluded.speaker_source;
INSERT INTO episodes(id,title,date,audio_url,description,link,speaker,speaker_source) VALUES('766c796ac35e1d11df53','Stranger Beings: Choose To Be Different','2018-01-07','https://www.buzzsprout.com/21035/621444-stranger-beings-choose-to-be-different.mp3','As we start our new series we see that God hasn’t called his children to be the same as everyone else. They are called to be different. Pastor Daniel preaches on how we are called to live as Stranger Beings.','https://podcast.app/stranger-beings-choose-to-be-different-e27126025','Pastor Daniel','description') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,date=excluded.date,audio_url=excluded.audio_url,description=excluded.description,link=excluded.link,speaker=excluded.speaker,speaker_source=excluded.speaker_source;
INSERT INTO episodes(id,title,date,audio_url,description,link,speaker,speaker_source) VALUES('2b74684fe9c6201bb30f','Christmas at Connection: Make The Most Of Every Moment','2017-12-31','https://www.buzzsprout.com/21035/620012-christmas-at-connection-make-the-most-of-every-moment.mp3','When the new year comes we may endeavor to make the next year the best it can be, but maybe that’s not the best goal. Instead of looking at an entire year, realize that every moment is our opportunity to make the most of the life God has given us. This encouraging message will strengthen you to make the most of this moment which is the only moment you’ll ever be in.','https://podcast.app/christmas-at-connection-make-the-most-of-every-moment-e27070987','','') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,date=excluded.date,audio_url=excluded.audio_url,description=excluded.description,link=excluded.link,speaker=excluded.speaker,speaker_source=excluded.speaker_source;
