INSERT INTO episodes(id,title,date,audio_url,description,link,speaker,speaker_source) VALUES('3a294f86d1fda2e461b4','Mesmerized: Listen to Jesus','2016-10-30','https://www.buzzsprout.com/21035/439064-mesmerized-listen-to-jesus.mp3','We all have voices that speak loudly into our lives. Family, friends, and bosses speak into our hearts. We also hear from our own voice. Our past regrets, failures, and present struggles team with anxiety about the future. These all shape our beliefs. With voices constantly speaking to you, where does the voice of Jesus fit into your life? What is he saying to you? Pastor Daniel preaches a message on this and encourages us to listen to Jesus.','https://podcast.app/mesmerized-listen-to-jesus-e14807075','Pastor Daniel','description') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,date=excluded.date,audio_url=excluded.audio_url,description=excluded.description,link=excluded.link,speaker=excluded.speaker,speaker_source=excluded.speaker_source;
INSERT INTO episodes(id,title,date,audio_url,description,link,speaker,speaker_source) VALUES('111d11847cc5789eee62','Mesmerized: See and Believe','2016-10-23','https://www.buzzsprout.com/21035/435345-mesmerized-see-and-believe.mp3','When we look at Jesus when he raised Lazarus from the dead, we see scenes from the story that empower us to believe. Listen to this sermon and see Jesus calling you out from death to life and from unbelief to belief.','https://podcast.app/mesmerized-see-and-believe-e14807076','','') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,date=excluded.date,audio_url=excluded.audio_url,description=excluded.description,link=excluded.link,speaker=excluded.speaker,speaker_source=excluded.speaker_source;
INSERT INTO episodes(id,title,date,audio_url,description,link,speaker,speaker_source) VALUES('dda892f5a3e83780a4d0','Mesmerized: Jesus is Greater Than Our Excuses','2016-10-16','https://www.buzzsprout.com/21035/435306-mesmerized-jesus-is-greater-than-our-excuses.mp3','When Jesus came back to his home town of Nazareth, he was met with crowds who found excuses as to why they didn''t believe in him. They knew Jesus since childhood, they knew his family, and they were waiting for the "real" Messiah. Their familiarity with Jesus kept them from believing. We do the same thing today when we think of excuses to not believe. It''s a good thing that Jesus is greater than our excuses.','https://podcast.app/mesmerized-jesus-is-greater-than-our-excuses-e14807077','','') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,date=excluded.date,audio_url=excluded.audio_url,description=excluded.description,link=excluded.link,speaker=excluded.speaker,speaker_source=excluded.speaker_source;
INSERT INTO episodes(id,title,date,audio_url,description,link,speaker,speaker_source) VALUES('192c337780d1704d0267','Mesmerized: Jesus is More Amazing Than You Know','2016-10-09','https://www.buzzsprout.com/21035/430668-mesmerized-jesus-is-more-amazing-than-you-know.mp3','It''s easy to forget how amazingly powerful and majestic Jesus is, only focusing on his gentleness and mercy. Pastor Daniel teaches how the gospel demonstrates both sides of Jesus, and Revelation 1:9-20 reveals how these contrasting sides come together.','https://podcast.app/mesmerized-jesus-is-more-amazing-than-you-know-e14807078','Pastor Daniel','description') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,date=excluded.date,audio_url=excluded.audio_url,description=excluded.description,link=excluded.link,speaker=excluded.speaker,speaker_source=excluded.speaker_source;
INSERT INTO episodes(id,title,date,audio_url,description,link,speaker,speaker_source) VALUES('de5ab50f6c4bd5f50dbf','Mesmerized: Jesus Offers Amnesty to the Doomed','2016-09-25','https://www.buzzsprout.com/21035/425978-mesmerized-jesus-offers-amnesty-to-the-doomed.mp3','It''s easy to look upon certain people and think, "They are doomed," and sometimes that judgment can be easily pronounced upon ourselves. The gospel shows us that we are all equally doomed, but then it shows us the good news that God offers life to all those who believe. Pastor Daniel preaches the story of the immoral woman weeping at the feet of Jesus and revealing the compassionate, gracious, and powerful love of Jesus. When we see Jesus as he is, we will be mesmerized by him.','https://podcast.app/mesmerized-jesus-offers-amnesty-to-the-doomed-e14807079','Pastor Daniel','description') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,date=excluded.date,audio_url=excluded.audio_url,description=excluded.description,link=excluded.link,speaker=excluded.speaker,speaker_source=excluded.speaker_source;
INSERT INTO episodes(id,title,date,audio_url,description,link,speaker,speaker_source) VALUES('9bca4aca6b204be3cf62','Mesmerized: When You Feel Like Giving Up','2016-09-11','https://www.buzzsprout.com/21035/421758-mesmerized-when-you-feel-like-giving-up.mp3','At some point in our lives we will feel like giving up on something or someone. In those times our faith in God can give us the strength to endure, but what do you do when it is your faith in God that you''re tempted to give up? Pastor Daniel shares how being mesmerized with Christ will rekindle our affection for, and our faith in, God.','https://podcast.app/mesmerized-when-you-feel-like-giving-up-e14807080','Pastor Daniel','description') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,date=excluded.date,audio_url=excluded.audio_url,description=excluded.description,link=excluded.link,speaker=excluded.speaker,speaker_source=excluded.speaker_source;
